        {
          "index": 1,
          "type": "input",
          "title": "You'll want to know: शुभम्",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "शुभम् (śubham) — \"good, auspicious\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "You have उत्तम (uttama) for good in the sense of best. शुभम् (śubham) is good in the sense of auspicious — bright, lucky, well-omened. Its root means \"to shine, to be beautiful\", so the word praises a thing for looking well rather than for being best."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "It is a wishing word, and it goes in front of what you wish for. शुभा यात्रा (yātrā) — a good journey. शुभा रात्रिः — a good night. Both halves are already yours."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "notice",
          "title": "What you've built",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "A wish you can attach to a journey or to a night."
            }
          ]
        },
